{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20104","headline":"送从叔校书简南归 · 孟郊","name":"送从叔校书简南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安别离道，宛在东南隅。\n寒草根未死，愁人心已枯。\n促促水上景，遥遥天际途。\n生随昏晓中，皆被日月驱。\n北骑达山岳，南帆指江湖。\n高踪一超越，千里在须臾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}